{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:1","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:2","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:3","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:4","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/5.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:5","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/6.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:6","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/en/14010538/7.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010538:1:7","lang":"en","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234650.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234650","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234650","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423465001:1":{"text":"A dwarf merchant named Ruack came to me recently with an idea to open a tourist route in Sal'thorin, centered on the ruins of Helthor's temple.","source_cn":"前不久有位名叫达克的矮人商人向我提出，想在萨洛克兰开辟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x044B30A9DC1A0F77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423465002:1":{"text":"It sounds like a win-win to me, so I've agreed to the partnership.","source_cn":"在我看来，双方都能从中获益……我已经同意了这项合作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3777C29F69BB1485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423465003:1":{"text":"But it seems like Ruack's run into trouble setting things up. He's near the <style=\"highlight\">Arcane Lift</style>. Can you help him out?","source_cn":"但那位商人的开辟工作似乎遇到了一些麻烦……他现在在<s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADEFF2B3C729F8B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But it seems like Ruack's run into trouble setting things up. He's near the <style=\"highlight\">Arcane Lift</style>. Can you help him out?","female":"But it seems like Ruack's run into trouble setting things up. He's near the <style=\"highlight\">Arcane Lift</style>. Can you help him out?","variant_male_record_index":"172014","variant_female_record_index":"172015","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"Ravion","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234660.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234660","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234660","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1423466001:0":{"text":"Took you long enough!","source_cn":"等你们好久了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8FE23757529236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人雷克":{"text":"Ruack","source":"矮人雷克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234670.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234670","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234670","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1423467001:1":{"text":"You're the ones Ravion sent to help, right?","source_cn":"你们就是沙利叶大人说的来帮忙的人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8E1967BF89D79E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423467002:1":{"text":"Didn't think building a tourist route would be this hard!","source_cn":"没想到这观光项目的开发难度有点大呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5DD94C2E9B7FF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423467003:1":{"text":"What's the issue?","source_cn":"发生什么啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFC585AEE997667D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423467004:1":{"text":"Everyone's all about taking photos at scenic spots lately! Helthor's temple would be a huge draw.","source_cn":"现在外面最流行的就是在观光点留念了！赫托老爷子的神殿肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9B617B1551770C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423467005:1":{"text":"But the place is crawling with beasts. I can still hear them howling! If something happens, who's going to take the responsibility?","source_cn":"可这神殿附近的野兽也太多了，我现在都能听到它们的嚎叫！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5297C6E3D04F8698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423467006:1":{"text":"And one site isn't enough anyway. I've heard there are plenty of Helthor statues out near the royal city. The dwarves would love those...","source_cn":"而且一个观光点也是不够的！我听说王城野外有不少赫托老爷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC3353A28F315A40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423467007:1":{"text":"I wanted to find the statue ruins myself, but... I don't really know my way around! Everything looks the same out there. I got hopelessly lost!","source_cn":"我本来想自己找雕像遗迹的位置，可是我……我不太认得路！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8130E3C2267D6F1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423467008:1":{"text":"Could you help me mark where the statue ruins are? There are lots of them scattered around. Just help me find three and that'll be enough!","source_cn":"你们能帮我找找雕像遗迹的位置，做些路标吗？老爷子的雕像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A1EA82DC6A399DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423467009:1":{"text":"So we need to <style=\"highlight\">clear the beasts near the Temple of Helthor</style> and <style=\"highlight\">mark the locations of three Helthor statues...</style>","source_cn":"<style=highlight>清除赫托神殿附近的野...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C9898AB4FCE2AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423467010:1":{"text":"Alright, one task at a time!","source_cn":"我们一件一件来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF55E15A76564EF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人雷克":{"text":"Ruack","source":"矮人雷克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234710.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234710","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234710","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1423471001:0":{"text":"The temple area is safe now!","source_cn":"这下神殿附近安全了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3436C0E50A8CED17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep4/quest_story/14234720.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234720","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234720","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1423472001:1":{"text":"How's it all coming along?","source_cn":"怎么样？事情进行的还顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C35B1099B56BBA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423472002:1":{"text":"All the beasts are gone!","source_cn":"野兽都清除干净啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x380394A15EAE0CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423472003:1":{"text":"And we've marked out some great tourist spots too!","source_cn":"适合作为观光点的雕像遗迹的位置也找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE86ADBD8E4D77C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1423472003":{"text":"And we've marked out some great tourist spots too!","source_cn":"适合作为观光点的雕像遗迹的位置也找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE86ADBD8E4D77C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423472004:1":{"text":"You really did it! Now nothing's in the way of the project...","source_cn":"真能干啊！这样项目的开发就没有阻碍了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDDDD89221145140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423472005:1":{"text":"When the underground tour opens, you'll be the first ones I invite to try it out!","source_cn":"等地底的观光的路线开通，我第一个请你们体验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA02346D3E8BFAE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_